<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30029" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγγυος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγγύη</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφίγυος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>secured, under good security</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνᾶς . . ἐγγύους ἐπὶτόκῳδεδανεις
					μένας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					32.15
				</span></i>
			 (but 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγγαιος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>reliable</i>, in 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλα -ώτερα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					15.197c
				</span></i>
			 (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχεγγ</span>-).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγγυητής, ἔγγυον
				παρέχειν</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				286
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Vect.</u>
				4.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				1350a19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				364.41
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Ephesus</span>), <i><span class="en">
				976.13
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Samos</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PEleph.</u>
				8.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Hebr.</u>
				7.22
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. τῆς προξενίας</span>
			<i>giving security</i> for . . , <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				9(2).4
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Hypata</span>), etc.: fem. in <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				11.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1051.10
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">i B.C.</span>/ <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>).</div>
